{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgusgHq9XYYjfQgFMaU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Credit-Limit Decision: CR-9206\n\nI'll apply the credit-decision procedure to Michael Torres's request for BlueRiver Logistics.\n\n## 1. The Request\n- **ID:** CR-9206\n- **Customer:** Blue River Logistics LLC (C-1002, CRM-2051)\n- **Current limit:** $100,000\n- **Requested limit:** $200,000\n- **Requestor:** michael.torres@northstar.example (Michael Torres, VP Sales)\n- **Request date:** 2025-09-23\n- **Basis:** Standard credit (no guarantee mentioned)\n\n## 2. The Customer\nBlue River Logistics LLC (DUNS 07-331-9025) is identified consistently across ERP (C-1002) and CRM (CRM-2051). **Account tier: Standard.**\n\n## 3. Policy in Effect\n**CREDIT-POLICY-2025** (effective 2025-01-01 through 2025-12-31) applies to the 2025-09-23 request date.\n\n## 4. Payment History\nInvoices due in the 12 months before 2025-09-23 (from 2024-09-23 onwards):\n\n| Invoice | Due date | Paid date | Days late |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| INV-61005 | 2025-03-01 | 2025-02-26 | 0 (3 days early) |\n| INV-61210 | 2025-05-30 | 2025-05-28 | 0 (2 days early) |\n| INV-61433 | 2025-08-29 | 2025-09-02 | 4 |\n\n**Status:** All invoices compliant with the policy's 45-day rule. No late payments exceed the threshold.\n\n## 5. Maximum Limit\n- **Account tier:** Standard\n- **Policy maximum:** $300,000 (Standard accounts under CREDIT-POLICY-2025)\n- **Credit support:** None identified\n- **Requested limit vs. maximum:** $200,000 < $300,000 ✓\n\n**The customer is eligible.**\n\n## 6. Requestor's Approval Authority\nMichael Torres is VP Sales. The policy grants approval authority to:\n- Accounts Receivable Specialists (≤$50,000)\n- Finance Manager ($50,001–$750,000)\n- Director of Finance (>$750,000)\n\n**Michael Torres has no approval authority** under the 2025 credit policy. (The separation-of-duties rule applies only if the requestor would otherwise be the approver; here, he is not qualified at all.)\n\n## 7. Required Approver\nThe requested limit ($200,000) falls in the range $50,001–$750,000, which requires **Finance Manager** approval.\n\n**Finance Manager:** Priya Shah (per organization_chart.md as of 2025).\n\n## Decision\n\nThe customer is eligible for the requested limit. The policy requires Finance Manager approval. Michael Torres (the requestor) cannot approve this request; Priya Shah must.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9206\",\n    \"customer\": \"Blue River Logistics LLC (C-1002, CRM-2051)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 100000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 200000,\n    \"date\": \"2025-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"michael.torres@northstar.example (Michael Torres, VP Sales)\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 300000,\n    \"basis\": \"Standard account tier; CREDIT-POLICY-2025 maximum for Standard accounts is $300,000\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2025 (effective 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Payment history (12 months before request): INV-61005 paid 3 days early, INV-61210 paid 2 days early, INV-61433 paid 4 days late. All within the 45-day policy threshold.\",\n    \"Account tier: Standard (CRM-2051).\",\n    \"Requested limit $200,000 is within the maximum of $300,000 for Standard accounts.\",\n    \"No parent-company guarantee identified for this customer.\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```\n\n**Answer:** Yes, the request **could have been approved** on 2025-09-23, subject to Finance Manager (Priya Shah) approval. The customer is eligible, and the policy requirement is satisfied if the designated approver signs off."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25230,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25230},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e768881-81e3-4ba1-8203-e8202f639968","uuid":"cd207f91-1097-4a3d-9c1b-feaba55e7249","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:27:35.822Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgusSuE4QkCe9Hdd5kM"}
